cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "maxtoki-mechinterp: Agent-driven mechanistic interpretability pipelines for single-cell foundation models"
abstract: >
  Mechanistic-interpretability pipelines for single-cell foundation models,
  with a deployment study on MaxToki-217M and a reusable audit framework that
  codifies recurring peer-reviewer-flagged failure modes. Pipelines are
  authored as markdown executable specifications consumable by LLM-based
  research agents.
authors:
